	"Arm with powder (glowing = on)": "Armar con pólvora (brillando = encendido)",
	"On: Musketeers, Officers, Horsemen and Dragoons come out with the shots the powder in the bank pays for (1 powder a shot: 10 a Musketeer, 5 an Officer's pistol; less powder, fewer shots). Off: they come out with no shots and fight with bayonet or sabre until they refill at a Mill, Town Hall or Powder Wagon; the powder is kept for the guns, and this Barracks refills nobody.": "Encendido: Mosqueteros, Oficiales, Jinetes y Dragones salen con los disparos que paga la pólvora del banco (1 de pólvora por disparo: 10 un Mosquetero, 5 la pistola de un Oficial; menos pólvora, menos disparos). Apagado: salen sin disparos y luchan con bayoneta o sable hasta rellenarse en un Molino, Ayuntamiento o Carro de pólvora; la pólvora se guarda para los cañones, y este Cuartel no rellena a nadie.",
	"Arm with powder off: recruits come out with no shots (bayonet or sabre); the powder is kept for the guns.": "Armar con pólvora apagado: los reclutas salen sin disparos (bayoneta o sable); la pólvora se guarda para los cañones.",
